{
    "title": "Weather Live\u00b0",
    "description": "Get the live weather forecast, storm radar, current temperature, precipitation intensity, wind speed, severe weather warnings, snow and rain alerts \u2013 all in one with Weather Live. It\u2019s the local weather around you and all over the world at a glance. \r\n\r\nRely on the accurate temperature forecast, and adjust your schedule to incoming weather. You won\u2019t even have to look out the window! The app brings the hourly weather forecast right to you with weather alerts! Weather Live provides accurate and visually appealing information for you to be prepared for any weather conditions.\r\n\r\nWith Weather Live, planning your day-to-day activities is easier than ever before. Simply choose the parameters you want to track:\r\n- Storm radar and storm forecast\r\n- Current and \u201cFeels like\u201d temperature\r\n- Lightning tracker\r\n- RainScope: min-by-min precipitation forecast \r\n- Wind speed and wind direction, wind chill\r\n- Pressure and precipitation\r\n- Sunrise and Sunset time\r\n- Weather Radar and Rain maps\r\n- Visibility (weather conditions for driving)\r\n- Weather alerts and current weather condition notifications\r\n- Other useful data accompanied by live animations\r\n\r\nCheck the hourly and daily weather forecast any time! Watch for upcoming precipitation (rain and snow) with an extensive weather radar map, or turn on rain alerts to stop the weather from taking you by surprise.\r\nOur weather app provides a real-time storm radar and alerts you to upcoming storms, so you can effectively plan your vacations and family gatherings. Turn on weather alerts so as not to be caught off guard. \r\n\r\nWant to customize the way the weather is displayed? You can easily switch between detailed or compact layouts to get weather data that is relevant to you and see first things first by rearranging your weather blocks. \r\n\r\nYou can check the forecast even without opening the app. Just add the visually appealing weather widget to your home screen, either as a full-size widget or just to show the essentials. Choose from nine weather widget options. \r\n\r\nWeather Live is a handy app that lets you track storms, wind, rain, temperature, and more to stay ahead of weather surprises. Go Premium for access to interactive weather maps and a fully ad-free experience.\r\n\r\nSubscription payments will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of your purchase. Subscriptions will automatically renew, and you will be charged unless auto-renew is turned off or unless you cancel at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current subscription or trial period. Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when you purchase a premium subscription during the free trial period. The cost of renewal depends on the Subscription Plan you choose. \r\n\r\nSubscriptions and auto-renewal may be managed by going to Account Settings after purchase or by contacting Customer Support.\r\n\r\nPlease note that some supplementary features and weather details in the basic version are subject to limitations (ex. UV index, 14-day weather forecast, Sun and Moon, Lightning tracker, Visibility, Air Quality Index, Weather widget, etc.). These limitations are also subject to change.\r\n\r\nA clear and simple live weather app will show you everything you need to know about the weather in any part of the world. Monitor the temperature, precipitation, wind, rain, and more in multiple locations. \r\n\r\nEnjoy the perfect balance of beautiful pixels and an accurate weather forecast!\r\n\r\nBy downloading this app, you agree to Apalon's Privacy Policy and End-User License Agreement:\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://apalon.com/privacy_policy.html\r\nEULA: https://www.apalon.com/terms_of_use.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get the live weather forecast, storm radar, current temperature, precipitation intensity, wind speed, severe weather warnings, snow and rain alerts \u2013 all in one with Weather Live. It\u2019s the local weather around you and all over the world at a glance. <br><br>Rely on the accurate temperature forecast, and adjust your schedule to incoming weather. You won\u2019t even have to look out the window! The app brings the hourly weather forecast right to you with weather alerts! Weather Live provides accurate and visually appealing information for you to be prepared for any weather conditions.<br><br>With Weather Live, planning your day-to-day activities is easier than ever before. Simply choose the parameters you want to track:<br>- Storm radar and storm forecast<br>- Current and \u201cFeels like\u201d temperature<br>- Lightning tracker<br>- RainScope: min-by-min precipitation forecast <br>- Wind speed and wind direction, wind chill<br>- Pressure and precipitation<br>- Sunrise and Sunset time<br>- Weather Radar and Rain maps<br>- Visibility (weather conditions for driving)<br>- Weather alerts and current weather condition notifications<br>- Other useful data accompanied by live animations<br><br>Check the hourly and daily weather forecast any time! Watch for upcoming precipitation (rain and snow) with an extensive weather radar map, or turn on rain alerts to stop the weather from taking you by surprise.<br>Our weather app provides a real-time storm radar and alerts you to upcoming storms, so you can effectively plan your vacations and family gatherings. Turn on weather alerts so as not to be caught off guard. <br><br>Want to customize the way the weather is displayed? You can easily switch between detailed or compact layouts to get weather data that is relevant to you and see first things first by rearranging your weather blocks. <br><br>You can check the forecast even without opening the app. Just add the visually appealing weather widget to your home screen, either as a full-size widget or just to show the essentials. Choose from nine weather widget options. <br><br>Weather Live is a handy app that lets you track storms, wind, rain, temperature, and more to stay ahead of weather surprises. Go Premium for access to interactive weather maps and a fully ad-free experience.<br><br>Subscription payments will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of your purchase. Subscriptions will automatically renew, and you will be charged unless auto-renew is turned off or unless you cancel at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current subscription or trial period. Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when you purchase a premium subscription during the free trial period. The cost of renewal depends on the Subscription Plan you choose. <br><br>Subscriptions and auto-renewal may be managed by going to Account Settings after purchase or by contacting Customer Support.<br><br>Please note that some supplementary features and weather details in the basic version are subject to limitations (ex. UV index, 14-day weather forecast, Sun and Moon, Lightning tracker, Visibility, Air Quality Index, Weather widget, etc.). These limitations are also subject to change.<br><br>A clear and simple live weather app will show you everything you need to know about the weather in any part of the world. Monitor the temperature, precipitation, wind, rain, and more in multiple locations. <br><br>Enjoy the perfect balance of beautiful pixels and an accurate weather forecast!<br><br>By downloading this app, you agree to Apalon&#39;s Privacy Policy and End-User License Agreement:<br>Privacy Policy: https://apalon.com/privacy_policy.html<br>EULA: https://www.apalon.com/terms_of_use.html",
